    "description_raw": "You implant a minor suggestion within the target creature’s psyche that makes it less inclined to resist mental intrusion. The target creature takes a –2 penalty on Will saves against all mind-affecting spells and effects for the duration of the spell.\n\nThought Worm II\nSchool enchantment (compulsion) [mind-affecting]; Level psychic 3",
